	measure 'success Last Month  %' = ```
			
			VAR CM = [success_rate]
			VAR PM = 
			CALCULATE(
			    [success_rate],
			    DATEADD(DateTable[Date], -1,MONTH)
			    )
			VAR perc = DIVIDE(CM - PM, PM)
			VAR _format =
			SWITCH(
			    TRUE(),
			    perc > 0, UNICHAR(11165) & " " & FORMAT(perc, "0.0%"),
			    perc < 0, UNICHAR(11167) & " " & FORMAT(perc*-1, "0.0%"),
			    FORMAT(perc, "0.0%")
			)
			RETURN
			_format
			```
		lineageTag: 4cac38ed-28d9-4e79-bf04-0d3e8da29ba3

